WEBVTT

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.920
Hey, uh... you're Kachi-san, right?

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.760
You're... Maru-kun, wasn't it?

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:41.250
Huh? Uh, yeah... Maru Sueharu.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.980
You know my name?

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.760
I know the names and faces of 
basically everyone in my class.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.530
Oh, I shouldn't be surprised.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.280
So what did you want?

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.060
Or were you talking to me without 
having anything to say?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.920
You must really take me for a fool.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:58.820
U-Um...

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:02.030
I read your novel, Kachi-san!

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.090
My novel?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.030
Yeah, yours.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:10.000
Would you mind telling me 
what you thought of it?

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.420
<i>Is the moment you fall in 
love easily recognizable?</i>

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:23.390
<i>Of course, people with a lot of experience 
in relationships might say it is.</i>

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.850
<i>But to be honest,</i>

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:31.300
<i>I've been wondering if I'm just 
telling myself that I could recognize it.</i>

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:36.720
It was really good! It moved my heart!

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:41.710
Thank you.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.810
It truly makes me happy 
to hear that from you.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:49.630
I'm glad I worked so hard 
to get to this point.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.050
<i>Love isn't something you fall into.</i>

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.840
<i>It spreads all over your body,
eating away at it.</i>

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.940
<i>In winter of my first year of high school,</i>

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.770
<i>I fell victim to love's poison.</i>

