00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.060
<i>She was my first love.</i>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.940
<b>11 Days Until Our Cultural Festival

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.840
Kachi's in here again!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.360
<b>Young Journal</b>

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.370
Yeah? Let me see.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:24.330
<b>Debuting in Her First Year of High School 
The Beautiful Winner of the Akutami Award</b>

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:24.330
<b>Beneath Her Cool Beauty Lies a Willful Body</b>

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:24.330
<b>Beneath Her Cool Beauty Lies a Willful Body</b>

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:17.330
Man, she always looks so gorgeous!

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.610
She's unbelievably beautiful!

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.210
And she has that aloof air that 
keeps people at arm's length.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.320
I love how she looks like she knows 
she's the hottest thing around!

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:28.350
Sueharu, are you gonna be 
in the confession festival?

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.800
Uh...

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.090
Nothing happened for you this summer, right?

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:32.710
Sponsored by the Student Council

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.630
Confession Festival!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.920
The Shouts of High School Boys!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.840
<i>Young men! 
Shout out your love at the finale of the cultural festival!</i>

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.730
Well, what about you, Tetsuhiko?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.050
It's your chance to confess to the girl you love! 
2:00 PM on Day 2 of the cultural festival 
Place: the gym

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:36.040
Yeah...

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.050
Entry: until 11:50 AM on that day 
Come see us in the student council office!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.500
Bouncing between seven girls 
is getting to be a hassle.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:42.300
I should probably narrow 
it down to one soon.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:46.420
Didn't everyone hate you after you got 
caught three-timing before summer?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.350
Don't be dumb. Obviously, they were 
all from different schools.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:53.830
After all, to this school's girls, 
I'm lower than trash in the hierarchy.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.480
For instance...

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:01.430
See?

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:04.790
Your mental fortitude amazes me.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:10.550
So if you're deciding at the 
confession festival, who's it gonna be?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:12.860
Kachi Shirokusa.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.850
What would you do if I picked her?

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.180
You are wrong. I do not care at all.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.540
Huh? What'd you say?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.480
Could you not react like that?

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:28.130
Even I'm embarrassed by your desperation.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:31.280
I just decided that I'm gonna kill you!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.590
Ow, ow! Dude, you're actually serious!

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.620
Don't get so bent out of—ow, ow, ow!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.110
Oh, Kachi...

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.220
I'm not falling for that!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.250
Huh?

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.730
Did you need me for something?

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.900
Er... huh?

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.490
What are you doing here?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:56.750
This is our classroom. 
Why wouldn't I be here?

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.170
Yeah, but... I mean...

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.760
Don't you usually eat with 
Mine in the cafeteria?

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.390
Meiko had other things to do.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.350
She said she'll be back soon, though.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.300
Oh, I see.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.140
What size do you think she is here?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.970
D... wait, maybe E?

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:14.010
Man, if only we could see the 
lines a little better...

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.970
Looking at the pin-up of 
Kachi that came out today?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.880
I hate dirty-minded people.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.900
What scum.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.400
Maybe you should all just die out.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.990
Damn. RIP.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.310
I'd say it's their own 
fault for looking at that.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.840
Let me give you some advice as your friend.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.310
She's out of your league, man.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.130
Huh?

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:44.400
She's smart, she's athletic, 
her debut work won the Akutami Award,

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:47.340
<b>Go get it back by the end
 of the day if you want</b>

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:47.340
<b>I'll be taking that.
I'll leave it with
the teacher</b>

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.360
and she got her own pin-up, 
making her famous nationwide.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.840
When she talks in that aloof tone, 
she's not trying to impress anyone.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.550
She's super popular on TV, too.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.860
Take my advice and just give up.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.360
Kachi and I actually get along pretty well.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.060
Huh?

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:01.800
I talked to her once last winter.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:05.530
We realized we live near each other, 
and we started talking now and then.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.790
Oh? And that's how you fell for her?

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.780
No!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.820
Kachi's not how she seems on the outside.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.290
She's, like... cheerful, even innocent!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.030
Come back to reality, please.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.970
Wow, that looks nice!

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:24.090
I've never seen such 
perfectly organized notes!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.710
I'm gonna copy them.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:40.050
I'm sorry. The notes are gone now.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:42.600
But they were mine, so that's 
not your problem, right?

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:48.380
Or are you a parasite that just wants to 
lick the sweet nectar off of everyone else?

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.920
This is stupid!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.590
Let me help you, Shirokusa-san.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.220
Thanks, Meiko.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.970
Kachi...

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.660
<b>Cultural Festival
Class 2-B
"Japanese Café"
Theme: A cute Japanese-style café where girls wear cute Japanese-style waitress outfits and serve tea
Costumes: Japanese-style costumes for girls, hakama for boys
