00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.700
You know, if you want a girlfriend,

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.660
why don't you just ask Shida-chan?

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:41.080
Ow!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:47.470
Shida-chan already looks out for you.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.430
If you asked her sincerely, 
she might actually say yes.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:53.150
No... Kuroha's not really...

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:58.190
Come to think of it, Shida-chan didn't 
come to talk to you at lunch today.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.210
That's rare.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.270
Is it? I'd say it happens every now and then.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.980
It's your fault. Go apologize to her.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.750
We're not fighting or anything!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.800
Also, why is it my fault?!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.180
It always is.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:17.140
Look, Shida-chan's out of your league, too.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.580
If she wasn't your childhood friend, 
you'd never even get near her.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:24.770
I know that. She's cute, guys like her,

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:28.270
and she's good at communicating. 
I respect her a lot.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.540
Oh?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:33.690
So that's how you feel about me, Haru?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.750
What're you being all shy for?

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.720
I guess even you have your cute moments.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.350
Your big sis here likes 
that about you, you know.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.680
D-Don't talk about "liking" me!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.480
And don't call yourself my big sis!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:54.590
Why? You're the one who 
puts me through so much.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.690
You're even more trouble than 
my little sisters, honestly.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.080
Damn it, there's Maru with Shida-san again!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.340
Guilty!

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:04.230
Having an older loli for a childhood 
friend makes him guilty!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.710
Take it easy, Goudo!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:09.370
Maru's a useless childhood friend, 
so Shida-san's still pure!

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.170
It's so unbearable, though.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:15.250
There's a cave in the mountains out 
back! No one'll find him there!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.450
They're gonna kill me!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.810
Hey, Haru...

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.570
Haru!

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.600
I-I'm just going to the bathroom...

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.950
I knew it. You're avoiding me, aren't you?

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:29.690
Gulp!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:33.400
Is it because you regret turning me down?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:39.120
You're running away when something 
this big's going down, Sueharu?

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.320
You're not getting away, Maru!

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.580
I'm sorry! Please forgive me!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.580
<b>Secret Technique: Rapid Prostration!!</b>

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:50.670
I'm talking to him right now.
 Don't get in the way.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.790
Sorry, Shida-san.

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:56.630
Uh-oh, Heaven help you guys.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.300
C'mon, time to go.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.240
You saved my skin, Kuro.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.240
Answer me.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.670
Do you regret it or not?

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.240
I-I do.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:13.110
So does that mean you do 
want to go out with me?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:14.970
Well...

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:19.510
I do think we'd have a lot 
of fun if we were a couple.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:22.030
But right now, I...

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.780
I'm really sorry.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.620
Huh...

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:32.000
Well, I guess I'll let you off the hook now.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.980
Just kidding!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.310
Asking you out was actually just a game!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.250
Huh?!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.140
Sorry I didn't tell you before now.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.830
You... You brat!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.530
Did you take me seriously?

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:50.820
Did you feel awkward and start 
panicking? Stressing? Agonizing?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:54.550
You should really feel 
more grateful to have me!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:57.490
Seriously, give me a break, Kuro...

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:00.560
It was a good lesson, though, wasn't it?

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.050
Maybe, but...

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.000
I'm still gonna do this!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.360
Stop!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.940
You jerk! You're honestly the worst!

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:08.760
Oh, c'mon.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.980
You can forget about copying my homework!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.590
Anything but that! Please!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.210
Your groveling means nothing, you know.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.970
<b>Your big sister is starting to
 worry about your future</b>

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:18.960
What?!

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.300
You're gonna go out with Abe-senpai?!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.250
When did he ask you out? And where?

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.690
Last week, when we went to the beach.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:32.120
Huh... So Kachi-san got a boyfriend.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:38.150
Isn't Abe the guy whose dad is an actor, 
so he recently debuted as one, too?

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:41.100
I guess that would make 
him a worthy candidate.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.570
I'm going home.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.920
Aw. I told him so.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:55.750
Haru...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.970
Damn it... Damn it...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.680
Poor Haru. You got shot down, huh?

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.980
I did not.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.630
Huh.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:24.370
Sorry, Kuro... but could you 
leave me alone right now?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.400
Talking to you will just make 
me want to lean on you.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.280
You can, you know.

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:33.780
You're so nice, Kuro.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:36.340
Especially after I rejected you...

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:39.130
Haru, go out with me.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.610
I told you, I just did that 
because I lost a game.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:46.000
You're forcing it, aren't you?

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:48.860
All that about a game...

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.800
Sorry for making you lie.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.870
You act like an older sister, 
but I know you like to be doted on.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:01.780
Hey—

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.630
A freebie for you.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.340
Because you figured it out.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.860
You're pretty dumb, but you're a decent guy.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:15.410
You're nice to me, even when 
you're hurting yourself.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.870
That's why... I like you.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.990
It was upsetting that you didn't choose me,

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:29.340
but that doesn't change my feelings for you.

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.540
I'll always be on your side, Haru.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.410
Kuro...

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.210
Go ahead and cry. It'll help.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.000
Kachi-san has no idea what she's missing.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.280
You're such a good guy.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.760
Damn it...

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.700
She was my first love...

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.950
Kachi-san's pretty cruel, isn't she?

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:57.670
Huh?

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.940
She was all buddy-buddy with you,

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:03.310
then ran off to her first choice 
once she saw her chance with him.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:07.170
I can't believe she'd treat you like that.

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:09.440
Thanks...

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:13.180
But even though I should give up,

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.230
I still feel like she might look my way.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.130
Pathetic, right?

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:23.850
Haru, let's get revenge.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:28.020
She made a fool of you.

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.540
You might forgive her, but I never will.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.440
Whoa... That seems a bit extreme...

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:37.760
Frankly, I've always hated Kachi-san.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.500
For real? What is it you hate?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.330
Everything about her!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.940
I never thought I'd hear 
you talk like that...

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.210
You've changed, Kuro.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:49.840
What's wrong with that? We don't 
need to hide anything anymore.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:53.170
Well, we've both been pretty 
frank with each other...

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:56.350
What do you think about getting revenge?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.610
To be honest... I'm so upset, I want to.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:00.950
But...

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:05.650
Just picture Abe-senpai 
and Kachi-san together!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.310
Huh?

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.110
They've been dating for a week.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.770
They might have their 
first date this weekend!

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:14.190
Think they'll go to the movies?

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:16.590
Then maybe they'll get dinner, then tea,

00:14:16.590 --> 00:14:18.890
and then maybe they'll 
go to the observatory.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:23.190
Then he'll walk her home,
and they'll try to say goodbye,

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:26.380
but Senpai will stop her, and their lips—

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.180
No! I can't believe them! Both of them!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.410
How is it good-looking guys get the 
best stuff without even trying?!

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.430
God might forgive you, but I never will!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.050
Guilty or not guilty?

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.530
Guilty!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:47.370
You're right! I do need revenge!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.690
You only ever have one first love!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.990
She might call me scum,

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.610
but I'm gonna get her back 
a million times worse!

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:07.790
I've been waiting to hear you say that.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:20.770
<i>Kuro once told me that her name, 
Kuroha, comes from "clover."</i>

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:23.330
<i>In the language of flowers, clovers mean</i>

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:28.740
<i>"good fortune," "think of me," 
"promise," and...</i>

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.330
<i>"revenge."</i>

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.980
I'll help you out, Haru.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.250
Yeah. I'm gonna avenge my first love!

