00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:54.970
<i>Now, our guest tonight is the popular 
young actor, Abe Mitsuru-san!</i>

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.000
<i>I've been watching your drama.</i>

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.170
<i>You have your own charm that sets 
you apart from your father.</i>

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.750
<i>Thank you. I'm honored.</i>

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.850
<i>My character in this new drama is 
unable to speak due to past traum—</i>

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.850
<i>Damn that cheater.</i>

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.700
<i>I had no idea you were the 
chief's younger brother!</i>

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.390
<i>I'm so sorry!</i>

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.280
<i>Please, it's nothing to worry about.</i>

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.940
<i>I don't want to lose.</i>

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.040
<i>I do have a weapon of my own.</i>

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.140
<i>I had it all along.</i>

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.260
<i>No matter what it takes...</i>

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>I'll show her!</i>

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.960
23rd Entertainment Club Round Table Meeting 
Topic: Cultural Festival

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.710
Return the key when you're done.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.160
Thanks.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.440
No problem.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:41.110
So you're saying you'll find 
Abe-senpai's weakness and expose it?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:45.310
Yes! Every man has a thing or 
two he wants to keep secret!

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:48.340
And there's no way Kachi 
will come out unscathed!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.430
People will see what lousy 
taste in men she has,

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:53.780
and she'll be labeled a useless woman 
who got snared by a useless man!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.570
Then both Abe and Kachi 
will hit rock bottom!

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.990
My own genius scares me.

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:02.200
I see.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.750
Well, it's not a bad idea,

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.660
but it's a little naïve.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.160
What?! What's wrong with it?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:11.800
You wouldn't be winning.
You just wouldn't be losing.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:15.300
So even if you get revenge, 
you'll only feel empty.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.630
What should we do, then?

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:21.140
Don't worry. You just need to end up happy.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.010
Then you're the winner, right?

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.060
Happy...

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.200
What would make you happy?

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.560
When you hear "happy," what comes to mind?

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.450
If Kachi confessed to me... 
that might make me happy...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.440
And here I'm talking about 
revenge. Stupid, huh?

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.750
Very stupid.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.890
You're where you are now because 
that didn't happen, remember?

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.180
But I know how you feel.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:52.220
Kuro...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.490
Hey, Haru...

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.210
Why don't you pretend to be my boyfriend?

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.060
Huh?! How would that get me revenge?

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:04.560
Kachi had a sweet side that 
she only showed to you,

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:08.410
so she likes you enough that she 
wanted to keep you around.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.530
I think that's a safe assumption.

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.640
O-Okay...

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.370
But if the boy she wanted to 
keep around got a girlfriend,

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:17.980
and if it was a cutie like me 
to boot, how would she feel?

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:21.120
You're really overconfident 
sometimes, you know that?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.560
That's bad?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.290
N-No, it's fine...

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.790
So that would mean...

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:34.300
<b>I thought I was
keeping him around,
but he was just
keeping me around...</b>

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.310
I thought I was keeping him around, 
but he was just keeping me around...

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:34.300
<i>Wow!</i>

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.980
That's exactly how I was hoping to strike!

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.070
Right?

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:41.780
Are you sure, though? You'd have 
to force yourself again...

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:44.850
Jeez, you really are an idiot, Haru.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.760
I get to go out with the guy 
I love, even if it's fake.

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.610
That's nothing but profit for me.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:59.720
Whoa... Wait, wait...

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:03.210
What is this? Am I that easy?!

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:04.340
Haru?

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.530
Calm down... Calm down!

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:15.160
Why don't you just tell your big 
sis how you really feel already?

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:17.840
K-Kuro! We shouldn't do this!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.830
Do what?

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.430
You know what!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:22.920
You're so cute.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.430
You're the one who's cute!

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:28.380
Even if it's fake, the idea of 
dating you makes me embarrassed!

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:30.150
And I'm a total creep for 
being happy about it!

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:32.480
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.060
No... I'm sorry.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.960
O-Okay, then, I guess 
we'll go with this plan.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:40.570
Right.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.160
Just so we can call it a done deal...

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.580
should we go ahead and kiss?

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.850
What?!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:47.990
Ow!

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:50.970
Wait... Kuro...

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:54.270
Have you lost all reason?!

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:58.110
I mean, isn't this the kind of 
situation where you'd just... do it?

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:00.960
So I thought a little kiss couldn't hurt.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.920
Right, Haru?

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.640
<i>H-Hang in there, my reason!</i>

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.880
Why are you holding back?

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:10.090
Just look at what I'm like already.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:11.750
You're so unfair.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.380
You're close...

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:17.510
It's okay, Haru.
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.040
What I'm afraid of is that 
there'll be no going back...

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:24.370
You're still able to think about the future?

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.020
I can't have that.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:30.340
N...

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.940
No!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:33.580
Huh?

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.740
Sorry, Kuro! See you tomorrow!

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.340
Wait... Haru!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.240
What a loser.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:48.350
Damn that Kuro...

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:52.850
No! What I need to do right 
now is get info on Abe!

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.770
Hey! Do you have a minute?!

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:00.810
<i>Everyone said nothing but good things.</i>

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.530
<b>...not sarcastic at all, I totally mean... 
...a really good, upright guy... 
...since he's so approachable. Anyway... 
...don't show up much, but even though I'm just a first-year... 
...Abe-senpai's singing? Of course... 
...about him? You mean in terms of relationships and stuff? 
...but even then, Abe-senpai... 
...everyone already knew... 
It was no use.</b>

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:04.290
<i>It's no wonder Kachi fell in love with him.</i>

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.040
Wait! I can't just give up!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.070
I am Envy Mask, and I burn with envy.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:12.010
If I hear good things 
about my rival in love,

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:16.490
it just makes me even more 
determined to expose him!

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.700
Wow, I'd love to hear more about that.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:20.300
Huh?!

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:21.970
Abe-senpai?!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:25.930
You're the one who's been asking 
around about me, right?

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.000
Word spreads fast, huh?

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.330
I just happened to find out.

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:31.780
If you weren't the one 
who'd been asking around,

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.640
I doubt you wouldn't have come up here.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:38.110
Wow... A famous guy like you knows who I am?

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.410
I wouldn't say I know you.

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:43.230
To be precise, it's more like I remembered.

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:48.440
Whatever might you be talking about?

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:54.410
I had no idea until just recently 
that you were at this school.

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:03.540
The former genius child actor,

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:05.970
Maru Sueharu.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:08.780
Huh?
